# Canyon Vaulter (3/1): "Whenever this creature saddles a Mount or crews a Vehicle during your main phase, that Mount or Vehicle gains flying until end of turn" (CR 702.122b,
# 505.1, 603.2). Reckoner Bankbuster (Crew 3, no flying): turn 5 Savannah Lions and Mother of Runes crew it, not the Vaulter, so nothing happens; turn 6 the Vaulter crews it in Bot2's main phase, which is not its controller's, and nothing happens; turn 7 the Vaulter alone crews
# it in the main phase and it gains flying; turn 9 the Vaulter crews it at the beginning of combat, which is no main phase, and it does not.

